'''''Melilotus italicus''''' is a species of annual herb in the family [[Fabaceae]]. They have a self-supporting growth form and compound, broad leaves. Individuals can grow to 0.39 m.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Melilotus italicus (L.)Lam. - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/703244|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Mifsud |first=Stephen |date=2002-08-23 |title=Melilotus italicus (Italian Melilot) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands. |url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/FABC/Melilotus_italicus.php |access-date=2022-03-05 |website=www.maltawildplants.com |language=en-us}}</ref>

